msgctxt "64"
msgid ""
"From what I hear, Tamashiro, the head of the Tamashiro Family, is quite the "
"playboy. He's got girls all over the place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"But the second he gets tired of one of them, he ships them off to one of "
"his brothels. He's a real piece of work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"I saw his latest conquest walking around town with her nose in the air like "
"she owned the place, but just watch, he'll dump her sooner or later."
msgstr ""

